  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></math></p><p>Point on&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>And,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#956;</mi></math></p><p>Point on&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>For finding&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>, we must have</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Solving&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>22</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></math></p><p>Therefore,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>23</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>46</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>And,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p>Distance of point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>23</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>46</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;from the plane&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>19</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><msqrt><msup><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>28</mn></math>&nbsp;units</p>"
  }
